<speak>That sounds like a good alternative, and you won't have to make the afternoon complicated. Thank you for taking the time today, Mr Tan. For any future telephone appointment, we'll arrange a suitable window rather than assuming the same day always works. You can tell us if your routine changes. I'll let you get back to your afternoon now. Please keep your personal documents somewhere secure when you clear the table, especially with people moving in and out of the room.</speak>